@startuml DOC80_D03_PreviewDescriptor
title DOC-80 - Diagrama UML de secuencia: preview y descriptor
' Convención: CODE = símbolo resoluble; EXT = sistema externo; CONCEPT = concepto.
' Fuentes: webservice/WebServiceImportarServicioWebModern.asmx.vb | Infrastructure/Workflow/ImportarServicioWeb/Sii/SiiImportProvider.vb | Infrastructure/Workflow/ImportarServicioWeb/Sii/SiiExternalImportProviderClient.vb | Infrastructure/Workflow/ImportarServicioWeb/Sii/SiiEnlaseAnnexContractMapper.vb | Infrastructure/Workflow/ImportarServicioWeb/Preview/ImportPreviewDescriptorService.vb | Infrastructure/Workflow/ImportarServicioWeb/Preview/ImportPreviewDescriptorRepository.vb
' Referencias CODE: VB.Endpoint.GetPreview | VB.Provider.GetPreviewContentAsync | VB.Client.GetAnnexPreviewContentAsync | VB.Mapper.Resolve | VB.Descriptor.Create | VB.Repository.Create
actor "Usuario Workflow\nEXT:WorkflowUser" as User
participant "Cliente moderno\nCONCEPT:ModernImportClient" as Browser
participant "WebServiceImportarServicioWebModern\nCODE:WebServiceImportarServicioWebModern" as Endpoint
participant "SiiImportProvider\nCODE:SiiImportProvider" as Provider
participant "SiiExternalImportProviderClient\nCODE:SiiExternalImportProviderClient" as Client
participant "SiiEnlaseAnnexContractMapper\nCODE:SiiEnlaseAnnexContractMapper" as Mapper
participant "SII\nEXT:SII" as SII
participant "ImportPreviewDescriptorService\nCODE:ImportPreviewDescriptorService" as Service
database "ImportPreviewDescriptorRepository\nCODE:ImportPreviewDescriptorRepository" as Repository
User -> Browser : Vista previa(ExternalKey)
Browser -> Endpoint : GetPreview(request: GetPreviewRequestDto)
Endpoint -> Endpoint : valida contexto y referencias autoritativas
alt contexto o capability inválidos
  Endpoint --> Browser : GetPreviewResponseDto(Error)
else autorizado
  Endpoint -> Provider : GetPreviewContentAsync(request, cancellationToken): Task<SiiPreviewContent>
  Provider -> Client : GetAnnexPreviewContentAsync(request, cancellationToken): Task<SiiPreviewContent>
  Client -> SII : consultarRadicado
  SII --> Client : colección imagenes
  Client -> Mapper : Resolve(payload, externalKey): SiiEnlaseAnnex
  alt idanexo no pertenece al radicado
    Mapper --> Client : SII_ANNEX_NOT_FOUND
    Client --> Endpoint : error saneado
    Endpoint --> Browser : GetPreviewResponseDto(Error)
  else anexo y recurso permitidos
    Client -> SII : descarga limitada
    SII --> Client : contenido binario
    Client --> Provider : SiiPreviewContent
    Provider --> Endpoint : SiiPreviewContent
    Endpoint -> Service : Create(context, content, utcNow): ImportPreviewCreationResult
    Service -> Repository : Create(snapshot): Boolean
    Repository --> Service : creado / rechazado
    Service --> Endpoint : descriptor opaco
    Endpoint --> Browser : GetPreviewResponseDto(DescriptorId, metadata)
  end
end
@enduml
